      ":question/problem": "Consider the following initial value problem:\n\n$$\n{y}^{\u2032}={x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-2,\\,y(0)=1\n$$\n\nWe wish to approximate the solution using the modified Euler method. Complete the first row of the table below, given that the step size is $\u0394x=1.$\n\n| $\\,x\\,$ | $\\,y\\,$ | $\\,{y}^{\u2032}\\,$ | $\u0394{y}_{p}$ | ${y}_{p}$ | ${y}_{p}^{\u2032}$ | $\u0394y$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $0$ | $1$ | $-1$ | $-1$ | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |"
